 "doc": "Zonal means of continentality (300 km smoothing) and of deck_window x deck_strength in the 15 bands x in [k/6, (k+1)/6) of x = |lat| / phi_H (both hemispheres together; a row with x >= 15/6 is in no band). Float32 field means in float32: default tolerance, measured worst difference against the float64 chain 2.2e-8. The coast threshold is at least 1e-4 from every texel (asserted). The same bands for a retrograde body (spin -1: the decks sit off the east coasts) with Hadley 22 and a 5500 km radius. Every band holds at least one row: all 30 outputs are finite. params.constants lists the module constants and the inline numbers the function reads (a port copies them from its own source and may assert that they equal these).",
